    "Recover endpoint data from WS-DWELLS-01 for 13:30–14:10 UTC, including PowerShell operational/script-block logs, process-creation events, download and browser history, and relevant files or memory.",
    "Retrieve the response body or a preserved copy and hash of upd.ps1, then validate its contents and provenance.",
    "Review domain-controller SMB/share-access auditing and relevant FILE-LV-01 records to identify the resource accessed from WS-DWELLS-01.",
    "Confirm with Dana and IT whether the download or related activity was expected or authorized."
  ]
}
